<h2>New friend request</h2>

<p>
  Hi<%= " #{@addressee.first_name}" if @addressee.first_name.present? %>,
</p>

<p>
  <strong><%= @requester.full_name %></strong> sent you a friend request on WIT Calendar.
  Friends can see each other's class schedules.
</p>

<p style="margin-top: 16px;">
  <a href="<%= @requests_url %>">Review the request</a>
</p>

<p style="margin-top: 16px; color: #6b7280; font-size: 12px;">
  If you do not know this person, you can decline the request.
</p>
